<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AVIS HOLDINGS ANNOUNCES CHANGE IN NAME.</title>
<headline>AVIS HOLDINGS ANNOUNCES CHANGE IN NAME.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avis Holdings said on Tuesday its shareholders had approved a change of name of the company to Avis Southern Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the move was aimed at identifying its region of operations to avoid possible confusion with Avis Europe Plc, recently listed on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom: +27 11 482-1003</p>
